<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png"/><title>Why I Dissented | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis</title><meta name="title" content="Why I Dissented | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="description" content="President Kashkari explains his vote at the March 2017 FOMC meeting."/><meta name="content centers" content="From the President"/><meta name="ess:pagetype" content="Article"/><meta name="ess:parenttopic" content="Policy"/><meta name="ess:contentcenter" content="From the President"/><meta name="ess:publishdatetime" content="2017-03-17T13:30:00Z"/><meta name="sortDate" content="2017-03-17T13:30:00Z"/><meta name="relative-publish-dates" content="Past 10 Years"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:url" content="/article/2017/why-i-dissented"/><meta property="og:title" content="Why I Dissented | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="og:description" content="President Kashkari explains his vote at the March 2017 FOMC meeting."/><meta property="og:image" content="/-/media/images/news_events/messages/2017-03/kashkarimedium-key.jpg?rev=b7fd340fde104bd1a37c6c293aba0c4d"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Why I Dissented | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="President Kashkari explains his vote at the March 2017 FOMC meeting."/><meta name="twitter:url" content="/article/2017/why-i-dissented"/><meta name="twitter:image" content="/-/media/images/news_events/messages/2017-03/kashkarimedium-key.jpg?rev=b7fd340fde104bd1a37c6c293aba0c4d?sc_lang=en"/><meta name="next-head-count" content="23"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/ba589f78dbc8687a-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/